# Multi-Tenant Routing Engine Setup

We've successfully converted Smart Learn AI from a single-app instance into a fully scalable multi-tenant SaaS platform, supporting path-based routing (development), subdomain routing (production), and DNS-enabled custom domains. 

### 1. Middleware & Routing Interceptor
- Built a Next.js [middleware.ts](file:///d:/Institute/institute1/middleware.ts) acting as the edge router.
- **Development Prefixing:** Translates `localhost:3000/[slug]/dashboard` into standard Next.js pathing by secretly stripping the `[slug]` from the route request and appending it exclusively into the header.
- **Enterprise Edge:** Detects `smartlearn.in` wildcard matches or fully customized external hostnames (e.g., `lms.college.edu`).

### 2. Tenant Context Resolution
- Refactored [layout.tsx](file:///d:/Institute/institute1/src/app/layout.tsx) to initialize `<TenantProvider>` which pulls `x-tenant-slug` and queries cached Institution metadata using React `unstable_cache`.
- Replaced over 30 instances of native `next/link` inside Navbars/Sidebars with `<TenantLink>`.
- **TenantLink Components** now automatically rebuild directory slashes based on the current mode (silently injecting `/[slug]/` when in a local dev or test environment, while returning purely standard `/` in production setups).

### 3. Absolute Database Security
- Modified [institutionActions.ts](file:///d:/Institute/institute1/src/features/admin/actions/institutionActions.ts) with autonomous `primary_domain` generation. Added duplicate detection engines recursively validating un-utilized `[slug]` arrays during Institution Approval transaction states.
- Deployed programmatic Database Migration scripts upgrading Schema rules and locking Domains directly into Postgres constraints.
- Executed programmatic Row-Level Security (RLS) enforcement traversing **all tenant-owned relations**, preventing multi-tenant data bleed globally.

### 4. Admin Routing Configuration
- Shipped the `/admin/domain-settings` dashboard which detects the active institution resolving against production or local URLs, allowing superadmins mapping configurations.
- Integrated Missing-Tenant global 404 Catch handler intercepting dead DNS resolution blocks.
